{"format":1,"key":"npc:zargh","path":"/lore/npc/zargh","name":"Zargh","kind":"npc","label":"Character","zone":{"key":"barrens","name":"The Barrens","path":"/lore/zone/barrens"},"levels":"","description":"At the Crossroads in the Barrens, Zargh sells meat and sends choice cuts to Orgrimmar.","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"npc:zargh","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["At the Crossroads in the Barrens, Zargh sells meat and sends choice cuts to Orgrimmar.","At the Crossroads, Zargh sells cured meat, shank, and game from the surrounding plains. Travelers heading into the wilderness can find provisions at his shop. He also sends choice cuts across Durotar to Innkeeper Gryshka in the Valley of Strength in Orgrimmar."],"hash":"046b1e","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"563f0446f8","sec":21},"female-narrator":{"sha":"726ebef15d","sec":22}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Zargh","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Zargh"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/npc/innkeeper-gryshka","n":"Innkeeper Gryshka","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/crossroads","n":"Crossroads","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/barrens","n":"The Barrens","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6365-meats-to-orgrimmar","n":"Meats to Orgrimmar","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6384-ride-to-orgrimmar","n":"Ride to Orgrimmar","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6386-return-to-the-crossroads","n":"Return to the Crossroads.","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/zone/orgrimmar","n":"Orgrimmar","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/item/zargh-s-meats","n":"Zargh's Meats","k":"item"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6385-doras-the-wind-rider-master","n":"Doras the Wind Rider Master","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/item/gryshka-s-letter","n":"Gryshka's Letter","k":"item"}],"wowhead":"npc=3489"}
